                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "As we observe #NBHAAD, let's remember the importance of defending HIV programs against proposed cuts. \n\nThese programs save lives and are crucial in our efforts to end the HIV epidemic. We must prioritize funding for all communities' prevention, treatment, and support services.",
